      ** Maintenance Fields
     A            RPIDAT         7  0       COLHDG('INITIAL DATE')
     A            RPITIM         6  0       COLHDG('INITIAL TIME')
     A            RPIUSR        10A         COLHDG('INITIAL USER')
     A            RPIPGM        10A         COLHDG('INITIAL PROGRAM')
